## SUMMARY

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                   │
│   👤 CUSTOMER:                                                   │
│   Sign up ──▶ Pick service ──▶ Find ONLINE workers             │
│   ──▶ Send request ──▶ Accept offer ──▶ Wait for worker        │
│   ──▶ Pay for repair ──▶ Rate worker                           │
│                                                                   │
│   🔧 WORKER:                                                    │
│   Sign up ──▶ Build profile ──▶ Get verified                   │
│   ──▶ Add Rs. 500 to wallet ──▶ Go ONLINE                      │
│   ──▶ Get requests ──▶ Send offer ──▶ Arrive & press button    │
│   ──▶ Rs. 500 commission deducted ──▶ Do work ──▶ Get paid     │
│                                                                   │
│   👨‍💼 ADMIN:                                                     │
│   Login ──▶ See dashboard ──▶ Verify workers                   │
│   ──▶ Manage users ──▶ Handle disputes ──▶ See stats           │
│                                                                   │
│   💰 COMMISSION:                                                 │
│   Only Rs. 500 visiting charge when worker arrives             │
│   NO commission on repair/job cost                              │
│                                                                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

*TL;DR: Workers need Rs. 500 in wallet to be visible. When they arrive and press "ARRIVED", Rs. 500 commission is deducted. Customer pays repair cost directly to worker. We only take visiting charge commission.*
